  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges Kristna R&#xE5;d implementerar ett program (Swedish Ecumencical Accompaniment Program in Palestine and Israel - SEAPPI) med fokus p&#xE5; internationell n&#xE4;rvaro f&#xF6;r att minska risken f&#xF6;r v&#xE5;ldsamheter i den Isrealisk-Palestinska konflikten. Informationsspridning &#xE4;r en del av programmet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Christian Council implement a program (Swedish Ecumencical Accompaniment Program in Palestine and Israel - SEAPPI) which focus on international presence in order to reduce the risk of violence in the Israeli-Palestinian conflict. Dissemination of information on the conflict is a part of the objectives of the program.</narrative>
